headers {
  X-Correlation-Id: bruno-run
}

docs {
  Product Catalog REST API (JAX-RS / Jersey) - every endpoint, every representation, with tests.

  Run in order with the Collection Runner (or `bru run --env local`). Folder "1 CRUD" chains requests:
  "Create product" stores {{sku}}, {{productId}} and {{etag}} for the following steps.
  Search tests assume demo data (SEED_DATA=true) but assert rules, not exact rows.
  CORS tests expect CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS to contain {{origin}}.
}
